02"/></fig><fig id="F3" position="float"><label>Fig. 3</label><caption><p>Microvessel density in microadenomas and non-neoplastic pituitary gland showing a significant difference.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-S61-g003"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>The characteristics of incidental pituitary microadenomas</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-S61-i001"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>PRL, prolactin; GH, growth hormone; ACTH, adrenocorticotropic hormone; TSH, thyroid-stimulating hormone; FSH, follicle-stimulating hormone; LH, luteinizing hormone; MVD, microvessel density; MA, microadenoma; NP, non-neoplastic pituitary gland; HCM, hypertrophic cardiomyopathy; SCD, sudden cardiac death; IHD, ischemic heart disease.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>